          "body": "Changes:\n1. Note saying it's a tomcat 4.1 how-to\n2. Note added to remember not to use two repository instances against the same physical storage. It seems to be a common configuration error.\n3. jcr-rmi how-to. I adapted the example from jcr-rmi javadocs to Tomcat 4.1 but maybe a note saying \"refer to jcr-rmi javadocs\" would suffice. ",
